/*
 * CONCEPT 02 - FESTIVE CHRISTMAS TREE GIFT DISPLAY
 * Pure Canvas 2D, one scene, 20 seconds, seamless loop, solid #00FF00.
 * Entry point: draw(ctx, time, width, height). Time is already in SECONDS.
 * Responsive FHD / 2K / 4K. No assets, fonts, DOM, dependencies, or glow.
